<title>USA: Lakehead Pipe Line Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Lakehead Pipe Line Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>DULUTH, Minn. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(unaudited; dollars in millions, except per unit amounts)</p>
<p>					     Three months ended March 31</p>
<p>							 1997	    1996</p>
<p> Operating Revenue				 $68.7	  $68.0</p>
<p>Expenses</p>
<p>  Power						 17.1	   16.5</p>
<p>  Operating and Administrative		  16.1	   16.3</p>
<p>  Depreciation					 9.8	    9.9</p>
<p>  Provision for Prior Years' Rate Refunds(a)  --	   20.1</p>
<p>							  43.0	   62.8</p>
<p> Operating Income				   25.7	    5.2</p>
<p> Interest Income				     2.3	    2.2</p>
<p> Interest Expense				 (10.1)	 (13.8)</p>
<p> Minority Interest				 (0.2)	    0.1</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)(a)			     17.7	  (6.3)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) Per Unit		     0.71	 (0.27)</p>
<p> Units Outstanding (millions)		   24.0	   24.0</p>
<p> Recalculated Net Income(b)			 --	   16.8</p>
<p> Recalculated Net Income Per Unit(b)	    --	   0.68</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Q196 results restated to reflect rate refunds and related interest accrued in response to 1996 tariff rate agreement applicable to Q196 and prior years. Q196 net income therefore reduced by $23.0 million, or $0.95 per unit, from amounts originally reported. (b) Recalculated information includes impact of tariff rate agreement on periods presented and excludes any amounts related to prior years.</p>
<p>Full co name is Lakehead Pipe Line Partners LP.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
